{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58321\" variant=\"standard\">先前的躁动与歌唱，此刻终于汇成同一股力量。声音一层层涌起，越来越明亮，也越来越炽热，仿佛那些久久无法说尽的情感，终于找到了毫无保留地倾诉的时刻。这里已不再是隔着距离的思念，而是一种近乎忘我的投入，连呼吸都被卷进不断升腾的声浪。最动人的是，这份激动并非一路奔向失控。每当情绪几乎要冲破边界，声音又微微停住、收拢，像是明明渴望彻底释放，却仍舍不得放弃最后一点分寸。于是每一次重新涌起，都比先前更加迫切。那种饱满得几乎无法承受的幸福与激荡，始终伴着一丝紧绷，让人既想随它尽情奔流，又不敢轻易松开。</WritingBlock>", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-de2193e0d67e45e98a1f017df35990c7", "response_sha256": "5542126013b7f5a93262bc1e29dbc3bf7b1d5a52d452fa5587b616551103c634", "session_handle": "a7636f77-bbb1-44a6-9a41-74aff2b9859c", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 0.838, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 6.605}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 218, "first_assistant_seconds": 13.297, "first_text_seconds": 26.984, "stream_seconds": 37.797, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 208}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_resul